From: CubeGM v0.14 <hermes@local>
Subject: [PATCH] retroarch-tinyalsa-s24-format.patch

v0.14: 写 S24_LE 匹配 acodec-ana 24bit DAC (24bit DAC 95dB SNR 物理上限).
设备原厂 acodec-ana 24bit DAC (rockchip.wikidot.com/rk3036).
442 retroarch.log 行 175-201 实证 tinyalsa-s24 / s24_3le init 成功 (Frame 8B, 无 underrun).
S32 在 acodec 上错位 (v0.7/v0.8 死路已证伪).

diff --git a/audio/drivers/tinyalsa.c b/audio/drivers/tinyalsa.c
index 9ecfeba..40a6907 100644
--- a/audio/drivers/tinyalsa.c
+++ b/audio/drivers/tinyalsa.c
@@ -2228,5 +2228,5 @@ static void * tinyalsa_init(const char *devicestr, unsigned rate,
    config.rate              = rate;
    config.format            = is_little_endian() ?\
-                              PCM_FORMAT_S16_LE : PCM_FORMAT_S16_BE;
+                              PCM_FORMAT_S24_LE : PCM_FORMAT_S24_BE;
    config.channels          = 2;
    config.period_size       = 1024;
--
